=== MDV-P1-016
status: Done
progress:
- Merged [PR #61](https://github.com/ALFRED-LUCIFER/medvya/pull/61): possible match = exact ABHA/EID/passport (deterministic Always Encrypted) or similar name + identical non-estimated DOB, never phone; privacy-safe candidates (initials, age, masked IDs); registration re-checks and saves nothing until resolved (quick mode too); decisions stored as MergeRequest (NotSame / Proposed) and audited with the actor; `POST /v1/patients/duplicate-check` and `POST /v1/patients` (Full access, facility from the session); quick form with debounced warning, review panel and "Resolve duplicate to save", en/hi/ar RTL, axe clean
- Tested on SQL Server (duplicate-check p95 10 ms with 50,000 synthetic patients locally); 13 mutations each caught
- Merged [PR #82](https://github.com/ALFRED-LUCIFER/medvya/pull/82): the same check and "Resolve duplicate to save" on the Review step of full registration, also matching ABHA address and passport
- Follow-ups outside this ticket: merge review queue, approval and suppression of "not the same" pairs (MDV-P1-017); thresholds to tune on pilot data
title: Duplicate warning while typing and duplicate resolution before save
type: Story
epic: MDV-P1-E05
prd: P1-05
screens: P-02
