- The access log does not drown in schedule and notification reads, and action names are translated.
- A reminder consent can be added after quick registration, and the visit panel says when reminders are scheduled.
- A revoked invitation reads clearly as revoked.
- Page loads do not sit on "Loading..." for seconds, and developer-facing text and plural slips are gone.

